 nd Floor West Gallery\, and write or draw your vision for our nation’s f
 uture. Your wish will then be added to the wall to encourage further discu
 ssion\, and to display the diversity of lived experiences\, stories\, and 
 desires of our community.\n\nThe Free Library encourages patrons to make t
 heir voice heard and delve deeper into civic engagement. By advancing…\n
 \nEvent website: https://libwww.freelibrary.org/calendar/event/171156\n\nL
 isting: https://phillyfamily.com/event/wish-wall-at-parkway-central-librar
