SUMMARY:Leaf and Learn
LOCATION:FDR Park Gazebo\, 1600 Pattinson Avenue\, Philadelphia\, PA 19145
DESCRIPTION:The FDR Park Leaf & Learn program gives our littlest visitors (
 ages 2-5) their first opportunity to volunteer at FDR Park! We begin with 
 a nature-themed read-aloud\, and then get to the outdoorsy fun with easy\,
  age-appropriate activities. Tasks include planting seeds\, “feeding” 
 a worm farm\, and picking up small pieces of trash with kid-sized grabbers
 . It’s a great way to get outdoors and teach your child the importance o
 f giving back to their community.\n\nCome to just one week\, or all five! 
 Older…\n\nEvent website: https://www.givepulse.com/event/911849-leaf-and
 -learn\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily.com/event/leaf-and-learn/2026-11-0
 5/
