SUMMARY:Fiber Craft Fridays at Kingsessing Library
LOCATION:Kingsessing Library\, 1201 South 51st Street (5lst St. between Kin
 gsessing and Chester Avenues)\, Philadelphia\, PA 19143-4353
DESCRIPTION:At Kingsessing Library\, little ones can learn the basics of cr
 ochet\, finger knit\, mushroom knit\, or just get cozy with some yarn on F
 riday afternoons. Yarn will be out in the children’s area starting at 3:
 30 pm\, and then Librarian Rachel will provide a short fiber art craft sta
 rting at 4pm every week (like pom-poms and yarn dolls).\n\nExperienced cro
 chet and knitting artists can share their craft with the next generation\,
  but all experienced levels are welcome.\n\nEvent website: https://www.fre
 elibrary.org/\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily.com/event/fiber-craft-frida
 ys-at-kingsessing-library/2026-11-06/
