DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261224T170000
SUMMARY:(Daily) The Declaration’s Journey at the Museum of the American R
 evolution
LOCATION:Museum of the American Revolution\, 101 S 3rd St\, Philadelphia\, 
 PA 19106
DESCRIPTION:At the Museum of the American Revolution\, families can view Th
 e Declaration’s Journey exhibit\, presented by Griffin Catalyst\, which 
 marks the 250th anniversary of the nation’s founding. Come together to e
 xplore the history and global impact of the Declaration of Independence fr
 om 1776 to current times. All in all\, this exhibition showcases how Ameri
 can Declaration of Independence has become one of the most influential pol
 itical documents in modern history.\n\nLearn more here.\n\nEvent website: 
 https://www.amrevmuseum.org/\n\nListing: https://phillyfamily.com/event/da
 ily-the-declarations-journey-at-the-museum-of-the-american-revolution-3/20
 26-12-24/
URL:https://www.amrevmuseum.org/
CATEGORIES:Community Event,Exhibit,Philadelphia Events
END:VEVENT
